{"id":"c08fdddee419d91f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Omitting Type Scheme","display":"df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme — ZFC Logic9 Omitting Type Scheme","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme — ZFC Logic9 Omitting Type Scheme","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[58-df-theory]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme — ZFC Logic9 Omitting Type Scheme"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"58-df-theory\">58-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,T,\\mathscr T,M,p\\in V\">\\(L,T,\\mathscr T,M,p\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9OmittingTypeScheme}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9OmittingTypeScheme}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type\\text{-}scheme}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9OmittingTypeScheme}_S(L,T,\\mathscr T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\theta)=\\varnothing)\n\\land\\mathscr T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(M\\models\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathscr T\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}{}\\land\\neg\\exists\\vec a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M)^n\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(M\\models\\varphi[\\langle v_i:i\\in n\\rangle\\mapsto\\vec a]\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type\\text{-}scheme}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9OmittingTypeScheme}_S(L,T,\\mathscr T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\theta)=\\varnothing)\n\\land\\mathscr T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(M\\models\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathscr T\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}{}\\land\\neg\\exists\\vec a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M)^n\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(M\\models\\varphi[\\langle v_i:i\\in n\\rangle\\mapsto\\vec a]\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The renamed family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr T\">\\(\\mathscr T\\)</span> avoids collision with the powerset symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>; one model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> simultaneously omits every listed type.</li>\n<li>Each type is assigned a finite arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, all of its free variables lie among <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1}\">\\(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1}\\)</span>, and no <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-tuple realizes every formula in that type.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FV}_L$ (free-variable operator, see [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"L,T,\\mathscr T,M,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9OmittingTypeScheme}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type\\text{-}scheme}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9OmittingTypeScheme}_S(L,T,\\mathscr T)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\theta)=\\varnothing)\n\\land\\mathscr T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;(M\\models\\theta)\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}{}\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathscr T\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{50mm}{}\\land\\neg\\exists\\vec a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M)^n\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\bigl(M\\models\\varphi[\\langle v_i:i\\in n\\rangle\\mapsto\\vec a]\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1830,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2498","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-omitting-type-scheme]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","90ce6acf0c65af45","d9b8711cda3f31ca","923884eb8fe4e61d"]}